{
 "duration": 58.36,
 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "text": "Your power's dead.",
   "end": 1.59
  },
  {
   "start": 1.59,
   "text": "Your car's stuck.",
   "end": 3.02
  },
  {
   "start": 3.02,
   "text": "The garage door won't budge.",
   "end": 4.87
  },
  {
   "start": 4.87,
   "text": "How do you get it out?",
   "end": 6.22
  },
  {
   "start": 6.22,
   "text": "It probably isn't locked.",
   "end": 8.14
  },
  {
   "start": 8.14,
   "text": "It's hooked to an opener with no power.",
   "end": 10.38
  },
  {
   "start": 10.38,
   "text": "So you unhook it.",
   "end": 11.79
  },
  {
   "start": 11.79,
   "text": "Look up at the opener's rail.",
   "end": 13.16
  },
  {
   "start": 13.16,
   "text": "A red cord hangs down.",
   "end": 15.18
  },
  {
   "start": 15.18,
   "text": "It's called the emergency release.",
   "end": 17.09
  },
  {
   "start": 17.09,
   "text": "Opener makers say pull it only with the door fully closed, if you can.",
   "end": 21.5
  },
  {
   "start": 21.5,
   "text": "The springs do the heavy lifting.",
   "end": 23.3
  },
  {
   "start": 23.3,
   "text": "But if one is weak or broken, the door can drop fast.",
   "end": 26.85
  },
  {
   "start": 26.85,
   "text": "So look at the springs first.",
   "end": 28.67
  },
  {
   "start": 28.67,
   "text": "If one looks broken, don't pull.",
   "end": 30.74
  },
  {
   "start": 30.74,
   "text": "Call a garage door pro.",
   "end": 32.54
  },
  {
   "start": 32.54,
   "text": "Clear people and pets from the doorway.",
   "end": 34.87
  },
  {
   "start": 34.87,
   "text": "If the door is stuck open, use caution and keep everyone out from under it.",
   "end": 39.2
  },
  {
   "start": 39.2,
   "text": "If it's closed, pull the cord down.",
   "end": 41.69
  },
  {
   "start": 41.69,
   "text": "Lift by the door, never the cord, hands off the hinges.",
   "end": 45.58
  },
  {
   "start": 45.58,
   "text": "A balanced door lifts smoothly.",
   "end": 47.68
  },
  {
   "start": 47.68,
   "text": "If it feels really heavy, won't stay up, or drops, stop and call a pro.",
   "end": 52.72
  },
  {
   "start": 52.72,
   "text": "Now you can drive out.",
   "end": 54.06
  },
  {
   "start": 54.06,
   "text": "Door closed, springs okay, pull the cord, lift by the door.",
   "end": 58.36
  }
 ],
